{"id":"662330","name":"西葫芦炒番茄蛋","author":"五加五左左","authorId":"11514294","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/662330/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"西葫芦","amount":"1根"},{"name":"西红柿","amount":"2个"},{"name":"鸡蛋","amount":"2个"}],"sub":[{"name":"酱油","amount":"1勺"},{"name":"盐","amount":"1匙"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"准备食材。","img":"images/662330/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"西葫芦去芯儿，切片。","img":"images/662330/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"西葫芦切片，西红柿切块，鸡蛋打散。","img":"images/662330/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"水烧开加一勺盐。","img":"images/662330/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"焯一下西葫芦，捞出来备用。","img":"images/662330/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"一点油放葱花，炒鸡蛋。","img":"images/662330/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"炒熟盛出。","img":"images/662330/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"西红柿炒软。","img":"images/662330/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"倒入焯熟的西葫芦。","img":"images/662330/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"倒入炒熟的鸡蛋，调味一点盐，一点酱油调色。","img":"images/662330/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"下饭菜。","img":"images/662330/step_11.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}